-- The bar: "the adjudication determination must not be enforced until after the expiration of that period or, if the
-- debtor applies within that period to set aside the adjudication determination, until after the application is
-- finally disposed of" (ruling of 2026-11-05 (d)).  TRUE while it cannot yet be enforced; FALSE once the period has
-- expired with no application, or the application has been finally disposed of.
