@ref O 36 r 3(3) (src:5264-5264)
GIVEN `the party who is entitled to enforce the adjudication determination or the judgment wishes to oppose the application` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the date the affidavit was filed` IS A DATE
      `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 36 r 3(3) the affidavit opposing the application is filed in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the party who is entitled to enforce the adjudication determination or the judgment wishes to oppose the application` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty does not arise; see `o 36 r 3(3) the duty to file an affidavit opposing the application arises`
        IF `the date the affidavit was filed` AT MOST `o 3 r 3 the last day for doing the act` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "within 14 days after being served with the application and the supporting affidavit"

